  "data": {
    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), any number of your units can start this **[action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)**, no 2 at the same **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)**. Each must be in range of an objective that:\n\n- is not your **[home objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)**\n- is not yet **decoyed**\n\nIf a unit still controls its objective as your turn ends:\n\n- The objective is **decoyed**.\n- Set an **operation marker** of yours in range of it.",
